WEBVTT

00:04:59.086 --> 00:05:00.463
I wrote a book about it.

00:05:00.463 --> 00:05:03.716
It's called "Fully Automated
Luxury Communism."

00:05:03.716 --> 00:05:04.717
(Laughter)

00:05:04.759 --> 00:05:05.926
The c-word.

00:05:05.926 --> 00:05:07.094
(Laughter)

00:05:08.429 --> 00:05:10.848
Fully automated, because we need
an economic system

00:05:10.848 --> 00:05:14.226
which reduces the necessity of human labor
in the production process.

00:05:14.226 --> 00:05:16.270
Luxury, because we need to expand

00:05:16.312 --> 00:05:19.190
the sense of liberty
and leisure time for all.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:24.111
Communism, because what I believe
is heading our way this century, maybe,

00:05:24.153 --> 00:05:26.447
could see the end
of production for exchange

00:05:26.447 --> 00:05:29.867
and the necessity of humans
to sell their labor for a wage.